ibus-ngosen (1.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ctrl+Shift and OFF switch English and Vietnamese for the app in use
    only, as in the fcitx5 edition.
  * Vim mode for each app in the mode menu; words starting with / stay as
    typed; Telex words with a forgotten circumflex or horn come out right.
  * The mode menu can be reordered and trimmed, with a key for the next
    mode; settings can be searched and have a What's new page.
  * Retype works on Wayland; Chrome incognito fields keep retype and
    retone.
  * Core ngosen-1.10.0-1.

 -- Nguyen Phi <nguyenphidt@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0700

