ibus-ngosen (1.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * On GNOME the engine removes the duplicate English (US) input source
    once and always types on the US layout.
  * Sen types straight into the Chrome and Chromium address bar, as the
    fcitx5 edition does.
  * The settings window lists its pages in a sidebar, About moves to the
    main menu, and the Check page reports what holds the input method and
    the forward-keys extension correctly.
  * The Check page finds what the fcitx5 installer left on the account
    and removes the files it wrote unchanged.
  * Backups record the edition that made them; older text fixed.
  * Core ngosen-1.9.0-1.

